B.aJN=new C.bs(B.eo2,["Look: tap a sheet, a hole or a surface to learn about it. The tools and the stack of sheets are on the floor.","Drywall sheet: tap a green place. The ceiling goes first. The narrow pieces need cutting first.","Cutter: tap an orange place to cut the sheet to size (score with the knife against the T-square, then snap).","Screw gun: tap a yellow sheet to screw it to every stud or joist.","Saw: tap a red mark to cut the hole for a box, the door or the window.","Corner bead: tap a door or window once its opening is cut, to protect the corner.","Mud: tap a blue surface for a coat. First the bed coat, then the tape, then two more coats. Wait for each to dry.","Tape: right after the first coat, tap the surface to press paper tape into the wet mud.","Sander: when the third coat is dry, tap the surface to sand it smooth.","Roller: when it is sanded, tap the surface to prime it."],x.l)
